Nurse With Tray doesn't know Joey. She has no time for friends.
拿托盤的護士不認識喬伊的 她沒有時間交朋友

166
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:28,580
She gets in that operating room and she carries that tray to the doctor..
她進去手術室把托盤交給醫生…

167
