誰會死？

169
00:11:32,850 --> 00:11:34,620
Man With Eye Patch!
戴眼罩的男人！

170
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:37,220
Now, you get in there, and you do your job.
現在你過去做好你的工作

171
00:11:37,460 --> 00:11:39,450
Yes, doctor.
是的，醫師

172
00:11:40,230 --> 00:11:43,290
Okay, let's try this one more time.
好了，我們再試一次

173
00:11:43,460 --> 00:11:47,870
Hang in there, Man With Eye Patch. Your tray is coming.
撐著點，戴眼罩的男人 你的托盤來了

174
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:52,540
