203
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:59,730
Didn't see you there, Geller.
沒看到你也在，蓋勒

204
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:03,700
Ross is here, so..
羅斯在這裡，所以…

205
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:10,000
And I was really hoping that maybe I could hang out.
我真的希望，可以跟你們待在一起

206
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:14,250
You know, what do you feel like doing?
你們想要做什麼呢？

207
