I'm working on this big presentation for tomorrow.
我在準備明天的一個重要報告

217
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:56,280
I should be involved in that, so get me up to speed.
我應該要參與，跟我說明吧

218
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:59,320
