What are you talking about?
你在說什麼？

238
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:23,610
Well, that thing that I have to do to make a baby?
嗯，那件能使你懷孕的事？

239
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:24,940
I faked it.
我裝的

240
00:16:25,750 --> 00:16:28,080
What? You faked it?
什麼？你裝的？

241
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,350
You know what?
你知道嗎？

242
00:16:32,890 --> 00:16:35,150
I don't need a tie.
我不需要領帶了

243
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:41,160
I mean, it's better open collar, you know?
我是說領子開著比較好，不是嗎？

244
00:16:42,530 --> 00:16:45,160
It's more casual.
比較輕鬆自在

245
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:53,430
Joey. Listen, I can't do this. It doesn't make any sense.
喬伊，聽著，我辦不到 這實在是沒有道理

246
