Wait a minute.
等一下

255
00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:37,770
Dr. Drake Ramoray and I work at the same hospital. Wouldn't I come say hi?
德克羅孟瑞醫生跟我在同間醫院工作 我不用過來打招呼嗎？

256
00:17:37,990 --> 00:17:42,080
No. No, see, you and Drake are having a fight.
不、不，你跟德克在吵架

257
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,850
About what?
吵什麼？

258
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:47,360
He slept with you.. Best sex you ever had, by the way.
他跟你上床… 順便一提，是你有過最美好的一次

259
00:17:49,500 --> 00:17:51,590
And then never called you.
然後再也沒有打電話給你

260
00:17:51,770 --> 00:17:55,860
And I just wanted a new daddy for Davey and Becky.
而我只想幫大衛跟貝琪找個新爸爸

261
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:59,460
Okay. Okay, from the top.
好了，好了，從頭開始

262
00:17:59,910 --> 00:18:02,970
And, action.
開拍

263
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:06,340
So I'm surprised you agreed to have lunch with me.
我很訝異你會同意跟我用午餐

264
00:18:06,550 --> 00:18:09,020
I'm surprised too. But yet, here I am.
我也很訝異，但我終究是來了

