Ralph needs to leave early today. He's going helicopter shopping.
洛夫今天要提早走 他要搭直升機去血拼

281
00:19:07,410 --> 00:19:10,970
But I love that man. I'd follow him into hell.
但是我愛那個男人 連地獄我都會跟他去的

282
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:13,040
Microphones.
擴音器開著

283
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:18,210
Well, there you go, you win. You win.
好了，順你的意了，你贏了 你贏了

284
00:19:18,390 --> 00:19:21,350
You get to do the presentation. You'll knock them dead.
你可以上台報告，讓他們愛死你

285
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:25,290
No one will remember that I worked here, and then Ralph will buy his helicopter..
沒有人會記得我在這裡工作過 然後洛夫會搭上直升機…

286
00:19:25,490 --> 00:19:29,020
and Super Gavin will just fly right alongside of him.
還有超級蓋文跟他一起飛

287
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:37,100
