00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:54,780
I should tell you that crying women make me very uncomfortable.
我應該告訴你 哭泣的女人讓我覺得很不自在

293
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:58,480
Well, you're not gonna like what's coming.
嗯，那你可能不會喜歡接著要發生的事

294
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:03,550
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
我很抱歉，我很抱歉 我很抱歉，我很抱歉

295
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,600
God.
天哪

296
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:07,960
Thank you. Thank you.
謝謝你，謝謝你

297
00:20:13,970 --> 00:20:17,340
I'm really fine. Don't worry. I'm great with children.
我沒事的，別擔心 我很會帶小孩的

298
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:31,280
Gavin Mitchell. Pleased to meet you.
我是蓋文米丘，很高興認識你

299
00:20:33,190 --> 00:20:36,030
Please don't fire my friend. Just let me talk to her.
請不要開除我的朋友 讓我先跟她談談

300
00:20:36,200 --> 00:20:39,030
- Okay, but this is her last chance. - Thank you.
-好吧，但是這是她最後一次機會 -謝謝

301
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,430
How about I do something for you?
我幫你一個忙如何？

302
00:20:41,600 --> 00:20:44,700
Tomorrow, I'll bring you a hat, cover up the bald.
明天，我幫你帶一頂帽子 讓你遮住禿頭

303
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:51,700
Listen, Phoebe. I was just talking to the director..
聽著菲比，我剛跟導演談完…

304
00:20:51,910 --> 00:20:54,900
and he was thinking maybe this time you don't hit Drake.
他說或許，這一次你不要打德克

305
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:56,520
You just wait on the tables.
你只要端盤子就可以了

306
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:59,720
I can't do that. I'm an actor. I have a process.
我不能那樣做，我是演員 我有我的程序的

307
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:03,320
You're a masseuse. You have a table with a hole in it.
你是按摩師 你有的是挖了個洞的桌子

308
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:07,420
Wait, I see what's happening here. You're threatened.
等等，我知道這是怎麼回事了 你感到威脅了

309
00:21:07,590 --> 00:21:08,720
What?
什麼？

310
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:12,330
I'm so good in the scene that I'm stealing focus from you.
我的演技好到搶了你的鋒頭

311
00:21:12,530 --> 00:21:15,760
Rise to the challenge, Tribbiani, because I just raised the bar.
接受挑戰吧，崔比亞尼 因為我只會提高你的水準

312
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:17,160
Come join me up here.
提升自己、向我看齊吧

313
00:21:19,310 --> 00:21:22,140
- Okay, great. I will. - Okay, good.
-好的，很好，我會的 -好，很好

314
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:29,840
Yeah, you can fire her, but I would call security. She won't go easy.
你可以開除她，但是最好叫保安過來 請神容易送神難哦

315
00:21:32,590 --> 00:21:35,680
You faked it? You couldn't have faked it.
你裝的？你不可能裝的

316
00:21:35,890 --> 00:21:39,880
Yes, you can. You just make the faces and the noises.
是可以的，只要裝點表情跟聲音

317
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:43,560
Guys can fake it?
男生可以裝嗎？

318
00:21:43,730 --> 00:21:46,670
Unbelievable. The one thing that's ours.
不可思議，明明只有女生才會裝的

319
00:21:49,370 --> 00:21:52,200
Why would you fake it when we're trying to have a baby?
為什麼在我們想要生小孩的時候 你卻要裝這種事呢？

320
00:21:52,370 --> 00:21:55,030
Well, that's actually why.
嗯，這正是我要裝的原因

321
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:58,170
Look, I'm starting a whole new career now.
聽著，我正在換工作

322
00:21:58,350 --> 00:22:00,370
I'm not saying I don't want a baby.
我不是說我不想要孩子

323
00:22:00,550 --> 00:22:04,010
I'm just saying maybe we could wait a little while.
只是或許我們可以等一陣子

324
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:05,580
Like a month?
一個月嗎？

325
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:09,750
- Or a year? - Really? You wanna wait a year?
-或是一年？ -真的嗎？你想要等一年？

326
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:13,050
It could be less than a year. I mean, you've heard my stuff.
不用到一年，我是說 你知道我的能力

327
00:22:13,230 --> 00:22:18,360
"Pants. Like shorts but longer."
「褲子，跟襯衫一樣，只是長一點」

328
00:22:21,200 --> 00:22:23,530
It'll probably be more than a year.
可能會不只一年吧

329
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:31,040
- I really wanna have a baby. - Well, yeah, me too.
-我真的很想要生小孩 -嗯，是啊，我也是

330
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:37,080
Look, I'll just get my old job back.
聽著，我回去做老本行好了

331
00:22:37,250 --> 00:22:39,720
No, I want you to have a job that you love..
不，我要你做你熱愛的工作

332
00:22:40,050 --> 00:22:43,450
not statistical analysis and data reconfiguration.
不是什麼數據分析跟資料重組的

333
00:22:43,660 --> 00:22:46,390
I quit, and you learn what I do?
我辭職後，你才瞭解我在做什麼？

334
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:53,230
I think there's never gonna be a right time to have a baby.
我想永遠不會有適合生小孩的時機的

335
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:55,490
Now you're unemployed, and in a little while..
現在你失業了，但一陣子過後…

336
00:22:55,670 --> 00:22:58,760
you'll find a new job that'll keep you really busy.
你就會找到一份讓你忙不過來的工作

337
00:22:58,940 --> 00:23:01,570
There's always gonna be a reason not to do this..
總是會有理由不能生小孩的

338
00:23:01,740 --> 00:23:05,970
but I think once the baby comes, we'll forget about all those reasons.
但是我想，一但有了孩子 我們就會忘了這一切的理由

339
00:23:07,480 --> 00:23:09,180
I guess.
我想也是

340
00:23:09,380 --> 00:23:12,320
I mean, it's always gonna be scary when we have a baby.
我是說，有小孩總是很嚇人的事

341
00:23:12,490 --> 00:23:14,920
It's gonna be really scary.
真的會是很嚇人的

342
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:18,020
I mean, God, when we have a baby..
當我們有小孩的時候…

343
00:23:18,190 --> 00:23:21,750
there's gonna be so much that we're not able to control.
將會有許多事情我們無法控制

344
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:26,300
I mean, the apartment's gonna be a mess.
我是說這間公寓將會一團亂

345
00:23:26,500 --> 00:23:29,260
I won't have time to clean it.
我會沒有時間整理

346
00:23:29,900 --> 00:23:32,600
What if the baby gets into the ribbon drawer..
要是寶寶跑到緞帶抽屜裡…

347
00:23:32,770 --> 00:23:35,440
and messes up all the ribbons?
把所有的緞帶都弄亂了呢？

348
00:23:35,610 --> 00:23:37,770
What if there's no room for a ribbon drawer..
萬一沒有地方可以放緞帶…

349
00:23:37,940 --> 00:23:40,340
because the baby's stuff takes up all the space?
所有的空間都被寶寶東西佔滿了呢？

350
00:23:40,510 --> 00:23:42,680
Where will all the ribbons go?
緞帶要放哪呢？

351
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:46,380
Should we go make a baby before you change your mind?
該不該在你改變主意之前 趕快去做人？

352
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:48,380
- Yes, please! - Okay.
-是啊，拜託快點！ -好的

353
00:23:48,560 --> 00:23:51,460
And I promise I will not fake it this time.
而且我保證，這一次我不會裝了

354
00:23:51,630 --> 00:23:54,920
Well, I wish I could say the same. I'm a little shook up.
嗯，我希望我也可以說相同的話 我現在有點激動

355
00:23:59,930 --> 00:24:02,270
I know you botched that operation on purpose.
我知道你故意手術失敗的

356
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:06,630
I can't prove it yet, but when I do, you'll be going to jail for murder.
我還沒有辦法證明，但是當我可以時 你會因謀殺而坐牢的

357
00:24:06,810 --> 00:24:08,540
I don't care if you are my brother.
我不在乎你是不是我弟弟

358
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:11,540
I'm not your brother.
我不是你弟弟

359
00:24:11,750 --> 00:24:13,650
What about my children, Drake?
我的孩子怎麼辦呢？德克

360
00:24:13,980 --> 00:24:15,950
No! No! No!
不！不！不！

361
00:24:20,620 --> 00:24:22,280
God!
天啊！

362
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


363
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
